# Downloaded PDFs stay local.
#
# Most journal articles are not yours to redistribute, and a private repository
# is still redistribution when you add a collaborator or make it public later.
# Version-control the metadata (../source_manifest.csv), the verified BibTeX
# (../../report/ref.bib), and your own notes (../../docs/literature.md).
#
# If a specific source is openly licensed and you have checked the licence
# terms, add an exception for that one file with a comment recording the licence.
*
!.gitignore
